# Lowercase is not a style choice: `TREE_FIELDS` (kvtier-patch.sh:328) spells the fields
# lowercase and `tree_field()` (:355) looks up `tree_<slug>_<field>` built from them, so
# an uppercase key is a key the tool never reads and the tree reports "no recorded
# reference". Worked example: 0003/.../patch.manifest:117-130.
# `git -C /home/user/vllm-38-next-v2.5/vllm-v2.5 rev-parse HEAD`, read 2026-10-22.
